This Term Sheet has been reviewed by Whitfield & Crane LLP, counsel to the Borrower, and Pendleton Howe LLP, counsel to the DIP Lender. This document is for discussion purposes only and is subject to all disclaimers and qualifications set forth on the first page hereof.

